Images

Engraving and rosette (src/assets/hero/engraving.png, src/assets/hero/water.png,
src/assets/rosette/ and the favicons in public/)
  From the plate of ornaments found at Warka (Uruk). W. K. Loftus, 1857.
  Public domain.

Seal impression (src/assets/roll/)
  A male figure, hunting dogs and boars, rolled on Text 179. Jemdet Nasr,
  ca. 3100-2900 BCE. The Metropolitan Museum of Art, 1988.433.1, Open Access.
  https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/329081

Tablet (src/assets/tablet/)
  Text 180, an account of barley and emmer, about 3100-2900 BCE, probably from
  Uruk. Drawing, The Metropolitan Museum of Art, 1988.433.2, Open Access.
  https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/327384

Texture (src/assets/texture/, src/assets/hero/texture-desktop.jpg and
src/assets/hero/texture-phone.jpg)
  The Wave, Coyote Buttes, Arizona. Photo by Romain Guy, CC0.
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Wave_rock_formation_-_Arizona.jpg


